<td id="S5.T3.2.1.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_tt" style="padding-top:0.75pt;padding-bottom:0.75pt;">Validation PPL (<math id="S5.T3.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\downarrow" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">↓</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\downarrow</annotation></semantics></math>)</td></tr>
<tr id="S5.T3.2.2" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S5.T3.2.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_t" style="padding-top:0.75pt;padding-bottom:0.75pt;">GPT2 <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib45" title="" class="ltx_ref">Radford et al., 2019</a>)</cite><sup id="S5.T3.2.2.1.1" class="ltx_sup">†</sup></td>
