</figure>
<figure id="A4.T6" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 6: </span>Validation ELBO with <math id="A4.T6.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p_{r}=0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p_{r}=0</annotation></semantics></math> on OWT. We use Qwen3-Embedding-0.6B as the continuous generation space for CCDD, and train all models for 131B tokens.</figcaption>
